      "content": "<b>Paragraph</b><br>\nThermal decomposition of gaseous X<sub>2</sub> to gaseous X at 298 K takes place according to the following equations:<br>\nX<sub>2</sub> (g) <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.032ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.262ex\" height=\"1.195ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -514 1000 528\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"21CB\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-21CB\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> 2X (g)<br>\nThe standard reaction Gibbs energy, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.357ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.536ex\" height=\"1.977ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -716 2446.9 873.8\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"394\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-394\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(866,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D45F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45F\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(1234.9,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43A\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(819,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D45C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45C\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, of this reaction is positive. At the start of the reaction, there is one mole of X<sub>2</sub> and no X. As the reaction proceeds, the number of moles of X formed is given by <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.439ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.296ex\" height=\"2.034ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 573 899\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D6FD\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D6FD\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>. Thus, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.65ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"9.725ex\" height=\"2.245ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 4298.4 992.2\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D6FD\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D6FD\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(599,-150) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D452\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D452\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(466,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(926,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D462\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D462\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1498,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D456\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D456\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1843,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D459\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D459\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2141,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D456\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D456\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2486,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D44F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2915,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(3366,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D456\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D456\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(3711,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D462\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D462\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(4283,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is the number of moles of X formed at equilibrium. The reaction is carried out at a constant total pressure of 2 bar. Consider the gases to behave ideally.\n(Given R = 0.083 L bar K<sup>-1</sup> mol<sup>-1</sup>)\n<br>\n<b>Question</b><br>\nThe INCORRECT statement among the following for this reaction, is",
      "options": [
        {
          "identifier": "A",
          "content": "Decrease in the total pressure will result in formation of more moles of gaseous X"
        },
        {
          "identifier": "B",
          "content": "At the start of the reaction, dissociation of gaseous X<sub>2</sub> takes place spontaneously"
        },
        {
          "identifier": "C",
          "content": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.65ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"9.725ex\" height=\"2.245ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 4298.4 992.2\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D6FD\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D6FD\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(599,-150) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D452\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D452\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(466,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(926,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D462\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D462\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1498,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D456\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D456\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1843,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D459\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D459\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2141,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D456\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D456\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2486,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D44F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2915,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(3366,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D456\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D456\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(3711,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D462\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D462\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(4283,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> = 0.7"
        },
        {
          "identifier": "D",
          "content": "K<sub>c</sub> &lt; 1"
        }
      ],
      "correct_options": [
        "C"
      ],
      "explanation": "On decreasing total pressure, the reaction will move in the forward direction where number of gaseous molecules is less.<br><br>Hence, option (A) is correct.<br><br>At the start of reaction Q = 0. From <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.885ex\" height=\"1.62ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -716 833 716\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"394\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-394\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>G = <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.885ex\" height=\"1.62ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -716 833 716\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"394\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-394\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>G<sup>o</sup> + RT lnQ, we have that for Q = 0 at the start of reaction <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.885ex\" height=\"1.62ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -716 833 716\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"394\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-394\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container><sub>r</sub>G is negative, this causes dissociation of X<sub>2</sub> to take place spontaneously.<br><br>Hence, option (B) is correct.<br><br>If b<sub>equilibrium</sub> = 0.7, then value of equilibrium constant is<br><br><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.555ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"21.101ex\" height=\"4.272ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1201.3 9326.6 1888.4\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(882,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D45D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45D\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1565.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(2621.2,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(495.1,611.7) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"38\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-38\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msubsup\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D6FD\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D6FD\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(656.4,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(599,-247) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D452\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D452\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(466,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45E\"></use></g></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(220,-377.4) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msubsup\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D6FD\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D6FD\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(656.4,289) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(599,-247) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D452\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D452\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(466,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45E\"></use></g></g></g></g><rect width=\"2025.6\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(5164.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(6220.4,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(495.1,516.8) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"38\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-38\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(389,0)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"37\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-37\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1667,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2089,477.1) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(220,-510.3) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"37\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-37\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(389,0)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"37\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-37\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1667,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2089,477.1) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g><rect width=\"2866.2\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container><br><br>The value of K<sub>p</sub> is greater than 1, which is not possible as given that <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.885ex\" height=\"1.62ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -716 833 716\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"394\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-394\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>G<sup>o</sup> &gt; 0 for the reaction.<br><br>Hence, option (C) is incorrect.<br><br>As <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://